{
 "duration": 68.148,
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "etiqueta": "",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 5.603,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "Your house sits right at the bottom of a hill. And every time it rains, the hill slides a little closer to your bedroom.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 0.3,
     "end": 5.323
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "etiqueta": "SOIL STUDY",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 5.603,
   "end": 9.595,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "First, you pull up samples of the soil, to find out how hard it's going to push.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 5.603,
     "end": 9.315
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "etiqueta": "",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 9.595,
   "end": 13.236,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "So you build a thin wall. And the dirt just shoves it over, like a domino.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 9.595,
     "end": 12.956
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "etiqueta": "FOOTING",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 13.236,
   "end": 18.072,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "So you give it a wide foot underneath, and now the weight of the soil holds it down.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 13.236,
     "end": 16.827
    },
    {
     "en": "This is a footing.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 16.947,
     "end": 17.792
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "etiqueta": "",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 18.072,
   "end": 22.023,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "But the hill can still push the whole thing forward, sliding it like a hockey puck.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 18.072,
     "end": 21.743
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "etiqueta": "SHEAR KEY",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 22.023,
   "end": 26.364,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "So you add a concrete tooth under the footing that bites into the ground.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 22.023,
     "end": 25.038
    },
    {
     "en": "This is a shear key.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 25.158,
     "end": 26.084
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b7",
   "etiqueta": "REBAR",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 26.364,
   "end": 31.604,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "Now, for real. You place steel bars that run from the footing up into the wall, so they work as one piece.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 26.364,
     "end": 31.324
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b8",
   "etiqueta": "FORMWORK",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 31.604,
   "end": 36.852,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "You set up wooden forms, pour the concrete, and shake it, so no air bubbles get trapped inside.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 31.604,
     "end": 36.572
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b9",
   "etiqueta": "CURING",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 36.852,
   "end": 41.645,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "Then you keep it wet for days while it hardens, so it doesn't crack.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 36.852,
     "end": 40.121
    },
    {
     "en": "This is curing.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 40.241,
     "end": 41.365
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "etiqueta": "",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 41.645,
   "end": 46.003,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "But when it rains, water piles up behind the wall, and pushes even harder than the dirt.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 41.645,
     "end": 45.723
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "etiqueta": "WEEP HOLES",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 46.003,
   "end": 49.861,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "So you leave little pipes through the wall to let the water out.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 46.003,
     "end": 48.461
    },
    {
     "en": "These are weep holes.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 48.581,
     "end": 49.581
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "etiqueta": "DRAIN",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 49.861,
   "end": 54.638,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "Right behind the wall, you add gravel and a pipe full of holes, so the water runs down and out.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 49.861,
     "end": 54.358
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b13",
   "etiqueta": "",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 54.638,
   "end": 58.05,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "Then you fill it back in with soil, one packed layer at a time.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 54.638,
     "end": 57.77
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b14",
   "etiqueta": "INTERCEPTOR DITCH",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 58.05,
   "end": 61.878,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "Up the hill, you dig a channel that catches the rain before it ever reaches the wall.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": true,
     "start": 58.05,
     "end": 61.598
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b15",
   "etiqueta": "",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 61.878,
   "end": 64.732,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "And you plant the slope, so the roots hold the dirt together.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 61.878,
     "end": 64.452
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b16",
   "etiqueta": "",
   "termino_en": "",
   "start": 64.732,
   "end": 67.348,
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "Congratulations! You have built a retaining wall.",
     "es": "",
     "nombra": false,
     "start": 64.732,
     "end": 67.068
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}